      dissolve_on: "the emitted-crate-partition thread derives the crate layout ByDerivation from the module graph (docs/plans/emitted-crate-partition-design.md), at which point the hand lists delete; interim backstop = an executing per-crate cargo-check consumer in the CI build job"
